      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "prompt": "A shop had 68 oranges. They sold 29 oranges in the morning, then received 15 more in a delivery. How many oranges does the shop have now?",
      "answer": "54 oranges",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Step 1 — Subtract oranges sold: 68 - 29 = 39.",
          "Regroup: 68 becomes 5 tens and 18 ones. 18 - 9 = 9. 50 - 20 = 30. 30 + 9 = 39.",
          "Step 2 — Add the delivery: 39 + 15 = 54.",
          "The shop has 54 oranges now."
